# Bot1's Takklemaggot kills Bot2's Memnite at Bot2's upkeep. The only creature left, Bot1's White Knight, has protection from
# black, so it is no creature Takklemaggot could enchant (CR 303.4f, 702.16c) and Bot2 can't choose one: Takklemaggot returns
# under Bot1's control as a non-Aura enchantment (no subtype, attached to nothing, and not put away by the state-based actions,
# CR 704.5m), and deals 1 damage to Bot2 - the dead creature's controller, not its own controller - at Bot2's upkeeps alone:
# not at Bot1's, and not at the upkeep it returned in, which had already begun (CR 603.2).
